+        # When `add_request_id_header=True`, inject the request ID middleware as
+        # the OUTERMOST middleware so that the generated `X-Request-ID` header is
+        # added to every response, including those produced by `ServerErrorMiddleware`
+        # for unhandled exceptions. Because the middleware list is iterated in
+        # reverse to build the stack, prepending it puts it at the end of the
